<title>NETHERLANDS: BEERS 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>BEERS 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.73 vs   6.35</p>
<p>    Net profit			    41.3  vs  38.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.30 vs   2.10</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.00 vs   0.78</p>
